[2026-09-26T17:24:51.278+08:00] [InterfaceDesigner][REQ-1-1-2]       "specification": "Renders a header ('GitHub Workspace') plus <AccountMenu /> and a main region with a heading. Reads useAuthSession(): 'loading' renders a loading state (data-testid 'workspace-loading'); authenticated renders 'Signed in as <username>' (data-testid 'workspace-current-user'); otherwise renders an alert-style message that sign-in is required (defensive only, since the route is gated). Renders no invented organization/repository/work-item rows: the collections section shows an explicit empty/not-yet-loaded state (data-testid 'workspace-collections-empty') and must not be replaced with hardcoded sample data; later features may load the real authorized collections through their own interfaces.",
