[2026-09-26T17:24:51.278+08:00] [InterfaceDesigner][REQ-1-1-2]         "200 { ok: true } + cleared cookie"
[2026-09-26T17:24:51.278+08:00] [InterfaceDesigner][REQ-1-1-2]       ],
