[2026-09-26T17:24:51.278+08:00] [InterfaceDesigner][REQ-1-1-2]       "responsibility": "Owns credential lookup, availability check, uniform generic failure reporting, and durable session persistence (unique identifier + account identifier + active status).",
[2026-09-26T17:24:51.278+08:00] [InterfaceDesigner][REQ-1-1-2]       "specification": "`signIn({identifier, password})`: normalizes the identifier (trim + lowercase) and looks it up against `accounts.username` or `accounts.email`; returns { ok: false, message: 'Invalid credentials' } for a missing identifier/password, an unknown account, a wrong password (constant-time-ish comparison through verifyPassword), and an unavailable/suspended account — the same message text is the only failure surface, so existence and which credential failed are never disclosed. On success it creates a cryptographically random session token (unique session identifier), inserts `{ token, account_id, active status, expires_at = now + SESSION_MAX_AGE_SECONDS }`, and returns { ok: true, account, token }. `getSessionAccount(token)` joins sessions->accounts, rejects unknown, inactive, or expired sessions (deleting the expired row) and resolves the public account shape { id, username, email, emailVerified }, which is the single source for 'the current user' on protected requests. `signOut(token)` deletes the session row. `SIGN_IN_MESSAGES.invalidCredentials` must literally equal 'Invalid credentials'.",
[2026-09-26T17:24:51.278+08:00] [InterfaceDesigner][REQ-1-1-2]       "inputs": [
[2026-09-26T17:24:51.278+08:00] [InterfaceDesigner][REQ-1-1-2]         "{ identifier: string, password: string }",
[2026-09-26T17:24:51.278+08:00] [InterfaceDesigner][REQ-1-1-2]         "session token string from the request cookie"
[2026-09-26T17:24:51.278+08:00] [InterfaceDesigner][REQ-1-1-2]       ],
[2026-09-26T17:24:51.278+08:00] [InterfaceDesigner][REQ-1-1-2]       "outputs": [
[2026-09-26T17:24:51.278+08:00] [InterfaceDesigner][REQ-1-1-2]         "{ ok: true, account, token } | { ok: false, message }",
[2026-09-26T17:24:51.278+08:00] [InterfaceDesigner][REQ-1-1-2]         "public account { id, username, email, emailVerified } | null",
[2026-09-26T17:24:51.278+08:00] [InterfaceDesigner][REQ-1-1-2]         "{ ok: true } from signOut"
[2026-09-26T17:24:51.278+08:00] [InterfaceDesigner][REQ-1-1-2]       ],
[2026-09-26T17:24:51.278+08:00] [InterfaceDesigner][REQ-1-1-2]       "callers": [
