[2026-09-26T17:24:51.278+08:00] [InterfaceDesigner][REQ-1-1-2]         "Returns null / 401 for absent, unknown, or expired cookies",
[2026-09-26T17:24:51.278+08:00] [InterfaceDesigner][REQ-1-1-2]         "Never leaks session internals into response bodies"
[2026-09-26T17:24:51.278+08:00] [InterfaceDesigner][REQ-1-1-2]       ]
[2026-09-26T17:24:51.278+08:00] [InterfaceDesigner][REQ-1-1-2]     },
[2026-09-26T17:24:51.278+08:00] [InterfaceDesigner][REQ-1-1-2]     {
[2026-09-26T17:24:51.278+08:00] [InterfaceDesigner][REQ-1-1-2]       "interface_id": "REQ-1-1-2-DB-SESSION-SCHEMA",
[2026-09-26T17:24:51.278+08:00] [InterfaceDesigner][REQ-1-1-2]       "req_id": "REQ-1-1-2",
[2026-09-26T17:24:51.278+08:00] [InterfaceDesigner][REQ-1-1-2]       "type": "DB",
[2026-09-26T17:24:51.278+08:00] [InterfaceDesigner][REQ-1-1-2]       "name": "accounts / sessions schema (session identifier, account identifier, active status)",
[2026-09-26T17:24:51.278+08:00] [InterfaceDesigner][REQ-1-1-2]       "file_path": "backend/src/database/init_db.js",
[2026-09-26T17:24:51.278+08:00] [InterfaceDesigner][REQ-1-1-2]       "first_line": 1,
[2026-09-26T17:24:51.278+08:00] [InterfaceDesigner][REQ-1-1-2]       "responsibility": "Owns the durable schema behind sign-in: the account credential/availability record and the session record persisted after successful authentication.",
[2026-09-26T17:24:51.278+08:00] [InterfaceDesigner][REQ-1-1-2]       "specification": "Created idempotently (CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS) during `initializeDatabase()` on normal app startup. `accounts(id PK, username UNIQUE, email UNIQUE, password_hash, email_verified, ...)` holds the credential digest used by sign-in; add an explicit availability flag (e.g. `suspended INTEGER NOT NULL DEFAULT 0`) so an unavailable account can be rejected — and must be rejected with the same generic 'Invalid credentials' as an unknown one. `sessions(token TEXT PK, account_id INTEGER NOT NULL REFERENCES accounts(id) ON DELETE CASCADE, created_at, expires_at INTEGER NOT NULL)` is the session record with a unique session identifier, the owning account identifier, and an active status (e.g. `active INTEGER NOT NULL DEFAULT 1` plus index on account_id) consumed by getSessionAccount. Schema evolution must stay centralized in this file and be idempotent for already-created database files (guarded ADD COLUMN or equivalent migration), never duplicated in feature folders.",
[2026-09-26T17:24:51.278+08:00] [InterfaceDesigner][REQ-1-1-2]       "inputs": [
[2026-09-26T17:24:51.278+08:00] [InterfaceDesigner][REQ-1-1-2]         "startup call initializeDatabase() from backend/src/index.js",
