[2026-09-26T17:24:51.278+08:00] [InterfaceDesigner][REQ-1-1-2]         "accounts uniqueness on username and email is enforced"
[2026-09-26T17:24:51.278+08:00] [InterfaceDesigner][REQ-1-1-2]       ]
[2026-09-26T17:24:51.278+08:00] [InterfaceDesigner][REQ-1-1-2]     },
